From: Chen Minqiang <ptpt52@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: connect AN7581 and AN7583 PON controllers

Adapt the PonWrt PON data and control API to the shared multi-SoC
Ethernet core. Keep QDMA ownership and DMA mapping in the Ethernet
driver, and bind optical controllers only to AN7581/AN7583 PON GDM2.

Recognize native netdev operations in the PON API and
TX completion path before accessing the Ethernet private data.

Based on the PON paths by pbs05.
Signed-off-by: Chen Minqiang <ptpt52@gmail.com>
---
